{
  "text": "UI Audit Restaurant A\nKIOSK ADMIN\nAhmedabad Flagship Store\nAPP\nRestaurant Admin\nKiosk Admin\nCtrl+K\nAssistant\nLogout\nWorkspace\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch · MAIN\nUI Audit Second Branch A · UIA2\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nKIOSK OPERATIONS\nDashboard\nKiosk Terminals\nOrders\nLive Orders / KDS\nFloor / Tables\nCUSTOMER EXPERIENCE\nMenu & Categories\nMenu Templates\nCustomisations & Tax\nKiosk Welcome Screen\nKiosk Appearance & Content\nKiosk Combos & Deals\nOffers & Coupons\nPAYMENTS & SERVICE\nPayments & Payouts\nReceipt & E-Bill\nPrinters & Devices\nCustomer Feedback\nStaff & Roles (RBAC)\nReports & Analytics\nSYSTEM\nKiosk Settings\nSync & Devices\nSubscription Plans\nAudit Trail Logs\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nApp Downloads\nSync & Devices\n\nWhether every terminal is in step with the cloud, and what needs your review.\n\nThis device: connection & diagnostics\nONLINE ● Connected\nConnected to the cloud. Everything is up to date.\nSync now\nLocal Core setup\n\nActivate this device first. Enter the six-digit pairing PIN shown in the Local Core server console. Pair each app once for this restaurant and branch. Cloud login and cloud sync work independently.\n\nLocal Core address\nPairing PIN\nPair Local Core\nBranch Core (restaurant server)\n\nThe always-on machine that lets every device work together without internet. Enter its address, e.g. 192.168.1.10. Leave empty to use the cloud only.\n\nConnect\nConnection\nCloud\nInternet verified\nYes\nWaiting to send\n0\nCould not send\n0\nOrders on this device\n0\nLocal storage\nHealthy\nApp version\n1.0.7\nStart this device fresh\n\nRemoves the staff list, orders and other data stored on this device and downloads this restaurant's own data again. Use it if you see staff, orders or items that are not yours. Orders not yet sent are set aside, not deleted.\n\nClear and re-download\nMenu publishing\n\nCurrent version: 1\n\nPublish menu\nDevices\nDevice\tStatus\tPending\tMenu\tVersion\tProblem\nUI Audit POSPOS\tdegraded\t0\tup to date\t1.0.4\t\nUI Audit POS_ADMINPOS_ADMIN\tonline\t0\tup to date\t1.0.7\t\nNeeds review (0)\nRefresh\n\nNothing to review. All synced data is consistent.\n\nThese are reported, never repaired automatically: payments and stock are reviewed by a person.\n\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE",
